#: rotor/ops/mirror_custom_plane.py:33
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Interactively set the custom orientation/pivot by snapping to geometry\n • Move mouse - snap to vert/edge/face under cursor\n • TAB - cycle Orientation+Pivot / Orientation / Pivot\n • LMB / SPACE - confirm\n • RMB / ESC - cancel"
msgstr "通过吸附到几何体以交互方式设置自定义方向/轴心\n • 移动鼠标 - 吸附到光标下的顶点/边/面\n • TAB - 循环 方向+轴心 / 方向 / 轴心\n • 左键 / 空格 - 确认\n • 右键 / ESC - 取消"

